# ── What never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run or by a build. A
# fresh clone with none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which
# is the intended first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and
# some of it must never be. (Git has no inline comments: each pattern sits on
# its own line.)

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# The Gemini key plus per-plugin credentials.
config/api_keys.json
# The dashboard's TLS private key and certificate.
config/certs/
# A LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody the account.
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens and client secrets (Gmail / Calendar plugins).
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Web / mobile build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
# Generated by scripts/build-web.mjs; Capacitor's webDir.
www/
# Local screenshots from manual testing.
.verify/
dist/
# Capacitor copies www/ here on `npx cap sync android`; regenerate, don't commit.
android/app/src/main/assets/public/
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/local.properties
android/.idea/
android/*.iml
*.apk
*.aab

# ── Android signing material. Losing these to a repo leaks the app's identity.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
